  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting the Ministry of Education officials participate in Education World Forum EWF24</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As part of the Embassy&#x2019;s objectives to improve bilateral relations and boost the capacity of the Ministry of Education Eritrea, British Embassy in Asmara is facilitating and supporting travel of the Ministry&apos;s officials, including the Acting Minister, who are invited by Secretary of State for Education to participate in The Education World Forum 2024. This will enable the Minister and his team to travel the UK and meet key UK-Education interlocutors to improve the country&#x2019;s education system. The Minister will also meet UK officials in a brief exchange, demonstrating the UK&#x2019;s value in the relationship with the Government of Eritrea.</narrative>
  </description>
